        {
          "text": "Then, all at once, everything went very quiet."
        },
        {
          "characterId": "pip",
          "text": "\"Shhh,\" whispered Pip. \"I can hear it rolling somewhere.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "From behind came a deep, rumbly sound: rumble, rumble, rumble."
        },
        {
          "characterId": "bo",
          "text": "\"Listen!\" said Bo. \"Which one is the wheel hiding in?\""
        }
      ],
